{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22281","headline":"吾雏 · 白居易","name":"吾雏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾雏字阿罗，阿罗才七龄。\n嗟吾不才子，怜尔无弟兄。\n抚养虽骄騃，性识颇聪明。\n学母画眉样，效吾咏诗声。\n我齿今欲堕，汝齿昨始生。\n我头发尽落，汝顶髻初成。\n老幼不相待，父衰汝孩婴。\n缅想古人心，慈爱亦不轻。\n蔡邕念文姬，于公叹缇萦。\n敢求得汝力，但未忘父情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}